pageType: final
background:
  type: image
  src: "https://t4.ftcdn.net/jpg/18/35/73/93/360_F_1835739381_bqI8nnGabMj5wCpGbwwKzRi1SGeN0wZ5.jpg"
  fit: {mode: cover}
  mask:
    type: gradient
    gradientType: linear
    angle: 90
    stops:
      - {position: 0, color: "#0C1E2BAA"}
      - {position: 0.4, color: "#0C1E2BDD"}
      - {position: 1, color: "#0C1E2BEE"}
elements:
  - elementId: top-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [490, 220, 300, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: main-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [140, 240, 1000, 55]
    content:
      fontSize: 42
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum"
      letterSpacing: 3
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>L'OCÉAN PRÉHISTORIQUE</p>

  - elementId: bottom-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [490, 310, 300, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$accent"}

  - elementId: closing-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [160, 340, 960, 180]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      lineHeight: 1.8
      align: [center, top]
      text: |
        <p>De la bête la plus massive (<strong><span style="color:$accent;">Shastasaurus</span></strong>, 81 tonnes) au chasseur le plus redouté (<strong><span style="color:$accent;">Predator X</span></strong>), ces géants des mers ont dominé les océans du Mésozoïque pendant plus de <strong>180 millions d'années</strong>.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:16px">Leur extinction à la fin du Crétacé a laissé place aux cétacés et aux requins que nous connaissons aujourd'hui.</p>

  - elementId: stat-line-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [200, 540, 260, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#2A4A5A"}

  - elementId: stat-1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [200, 555, 260, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>12</p>

  - elementId: stat-1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [200, 600, 260, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>ANIMAUX</p>

  - elementId: stat-line-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [510, 540, 260, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#2A4A5A"}

  - elementId: stat-2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 555, 260, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>180M+</p>

  - elementId: stat-2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [510, 600, 260, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>ANNÉES DE DOMINATION</p>

  - elementId: stat-line-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [820, 540, 260, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "#2A4A5A"}

  - elementId: stat-3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 555, 260, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "Oranienbaum"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>3</p>

  - elementId: stat-3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 600, 260, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$muted"
      fontFamily: "Liter"
      letterSpacing: 2
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>ÈRES GÉOLOGIQUES</p>

  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 700, 1280, 20]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
